			},
			"date": "2026-06-02T17:53:11.949Z",
			"content": "<p>The Long Halloween (Jeff Loeb, Tim Sale) is an old-school Batman story, its art is so different and the writing is very good, classic detective-style fare! My personal favorite!</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
